{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Instagram 在最近一至兩星期左右新增 Apple Music 功能，用戶可將 Apple Music 帳戶連結至 Instagram，把在平台上遇到的歌曲儲存至 Apple Music 播放清單。</p><h2>連結後可儲存歌曲</h2><p>在 Instagram 的帖文或限時動態點按歌曲連結時，畫面會顯示提示，要求用戶把 Instagram 連結至 Apple Music。帳戶連結後，用戶可在帖文點按歌曲名稱，再使用「Add to Apple Music」按鈕儲存歌曲。</p><p></p><p>歌曲會存入 Apple Music 應用程式的資料庫內「Instagram Songs」播放清單。Instagram 過往已支援在限時動態及直接訊息分享 Apple Music 歌曲，但沒有把 Instagram 內容儲存至 Apple Music 的選項；Spotify 亦支援把 Instagram 上的歌曲儲存至其「Liked Songs」部分。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"與 Apple Music 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c83ef7a6260532bc87444fc06c80e3cd9acdd608a940c9d6d3e707cfe7546e59/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F85cdf5767f18db0540ffae1a8c489f7e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:03:55.300288+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":406,"images":1,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:29:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:37.948736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:57:34.039397+00:00","content_hash":"b8a4308af3216631d95c0b5dd1b3c352eee0ae2eeefc826e7441f752f572842a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}